{"4344320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scandere", "steam_appid": 4344320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/65dea93e8bea52c90318c5b3e1504cf7.poster.avif?t=1779477257\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/65dea93e8bea52c90318c5b3e1504cf7.webm?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/65dea93e8bea52c90318c5b3e1504cf7.mp4?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCANDERE</strong> is a fast-paced platformer with rougelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE WORLD HAS COME TO AN END</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>ALL LEFT IS SCRAPS OF HUMANITY</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>REACH HEAVEN, </strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>OR LIVE THE REST OF YOUR PAINFUL DAYS IN THE SHADOW OF HUMANITY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/8ded1fb2858aafa16419f8008eb4ab8d.poster.avif?t=1779477257\" aria-label=\"FAST-PACED GAMEPLAY\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/8ded1fb2858aafa16419f8008eb4ab8d.webm?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/8ded1fb2858aafa16419f8008eb4ab8d.mp4?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scandere is a fast-paced 2D platformer, play fast and dodge enemys and projectiles, stomp on them, even shoot a grenade at them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The movement is simple but hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>so do your best!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROUGLIKE ELEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/8385991552feedc1b18577195cdc589b.poster.avif?t=1779477257\" aria-label=\"OVER 20+ ITEMS (for now...)\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/8385991552feedc1b18577195cdc589b.webm?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/8385991552feedc1b18577195cdc589b.mp4?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items change how your run goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometime you can get lucky and get only good ones, but thats rare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to get more consistantly good runs, you have to account for everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main twist in the game is that you need to <strong>Managing curses and difficulty itself. Take risky deals and recive items that benefit you..</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br>Those risky deals come to a cost of <strong>Curses,</strong> so you have to watch out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They can overwhelm you...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNERGIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items working together to make a cool synergy, there are over 100+ in the game currently, and more coming! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/24988d99aab45343940db70e795deec7.poster.avif?t=1779477257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/24988d99aab45343940db70e795deec7.webm?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/24988d99aab45343940db70e795deec7.mp4?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/65dea93e8bea52c90318c5b3e1504cf7.poster.avif?t=1779477257\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/65dea93e8bea52c90318c5b3e1504cf7.webm?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/65dea93e8bea52c90318c5b3e1504cf7.mp4?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCANDERE</strong> is a fast-paced platformer with rougelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE WORLD HAS COME TO AN END</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>ALL LEFT IS SCRAPS OF HUMANITY</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>REACH HEAVEN, </strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>OR LIVE THE REST OF YOUR PAINFUL DAYS IN THE SHADOW OF HUMANITY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"