 ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to get more consistantly good runs, you have to account for everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main twist in the game is that you need to <strong>Managing curses and difficulty itself. Take risky deals and recive items that benefit you..</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br>Those risky deals come to a cost of <strong>Curses,</strong> so you have to watch out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>They can overwhelm you...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNERGIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items working together to make a cool synergy, there are over 100+ in the game currently, and more coming! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/24988d99aab45343940db70e795deec7.poster.avif?t=1779477257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/24988d99aab45343940db70e795deec7.webm?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/extras/24988d99aab45343940db70e795deec7.mp4?t=1779477257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A fast-paced action platformer roguelike centered on intense curse management and powerful item synergies. Scale a lethal tower to reach the heavens.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/a325b34580a392ed84cde971b9b9e8ac4591749f/header.jpg?t=1779477257", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4344320/4ed4b635dc9b65ee29330d0d519d381d4f6feb07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779477257", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamsta